### Nested Routes with Outlet

```jac
cl import from "@jac/runtime"

```
mathlib/
├── __init__.jac         # Re-exports for convenience
├── operations.jac
├── constants.jac
└── calculator.jac
```

<!-- jac-skip -->
```jac
import from .operations { add, subtract, multiply, divide }
import from .constants { PI, E, GOLDEN_RATIO }
